<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Weazel factor -->
  <Weazel_WeazelFactor.label>鼬族因子</Weazel_WeazelFactor.label>
  <!-- EN: Weazel -->
  <Weazel_WeazelFactor.labelShortAdj>鼬族</Weazel_WeazelFactor.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: A unique genetic factor carried by every Weazel. Whatever race's genes she inherits, a Weazel face and body will always appear, and other genes that affect appearance are deactivated.\n\nThis factor is always passed on to children even if only one parent carries it, and it cannot be obtained through gene extraction. -->
  <Weazel_WeazelFactor.description>所有鼬族都带有的独特遗传因子。无论继承了哪个种族的基因，都必定呈现鼬族的脸孔与身体，其他影响外观的基因则会失效。\n\n只要父母其中一方带有此因子，就必定会遗传给子女，而且无法透过基因抽取取得。</Weazel_WeazelFactor.description>
</LanguageData>
